{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55687","headline":"题清乐亭 · 钱师悦","name":"题清乐亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林亭虚敞依金地，终待休宦此结庐。\n因共支公话空理，人中清乐更无如。\n（见复旦大学图书馆藏旧抄本《至元嘉禾志》卷三十二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱师悦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}